---
pagination:
  data: pages.years.locales
  size: 1
  alias: locale
permalink: "{{ locale.permalink }}"
---
{#
  TAQATHON - YEAR ARCHIVE PAGE TEMPLATE (src/pages/years.njk)
  --------------------------------------------------------------
  One template, but unlike every OTHER page here (which always
  produces exactly one AR/EN pair), this one produces a pair PER
  COMPLETED SEASON — src/_data/pages/years.js builds its "locales"
  list by scanning src/_data/copy/years/ (via src/_lib/years.js) for
  whichever "<year>.ar.json" + "<year>.en.json" pairs already exist,
  so adding Taqathon 2027's archive later means adding two new JSON
  files here, not touching this template or its data file at all.

  Content is deliberately plain and historical — no countdown, no
  registration CTAs, nothing that implies the season is still active.
  Five pieces, each shown only if the year's data file actually has
  something for it:
    - Advisory/educational workshop sessions held that season (title,
      presenter, date/time — no join links, since those meetings are
      long over by the time this page exists)
    - Closing ceremony details (date/time/location + map link)
    - Final results (winners list, ranked)
    - A link out to the photo gallery from that season
    - Any announcements flagged "important" during that season and
      carried over before the live announcements feed was cleared for
      the next one (empty for 2025 — that flag didn't exist yet when
      that season ran; real for seasons archived from here on).

  VISUAL SYSTEM (Phase 3, editorial rollout — see about.njk for the
  token-system rationale). Deliberately quieter than the live-season
  pages: no orb decorations, no badge pill — this is a historical
  record, not a "come do something" page, so the hero is plain text
  on cream and the four possible blocks are stacked cards on sky,
  same white/surface card pattern as every other content card in this
  redesign. Winners keep the "01/02/03" mono-numeral ranking style
  tracks.njk/sponsors.njk established for ordered lists, since a
  ranked results list is exactly that shape.

  TO ADD A NEW YEAR:
    1. Create src/_data/copy/years/<year>.ar.json and <year>.en.json
       (copy 2025's files as a starting shape).
    2. Rebuild — that's it, no other file needs to change.
#}
{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}
{% block pageHead %}
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Big+Shoulders+Display:wght@600;700;800&family=Tajawal:wght@700;800;900&family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
{% endblock %}
{% block pageStyle %}
.yr-hero{ background:var(--color-cream); color:var(--brand-dark); padding:3.5rem 0 2.5rem; text-align:center; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,40,76,.08); }
[data-bs-theme="dark"] .yr-hero{ color:var(--text); border-bottom-color:rgba(255,255,255,.08); }
.yr-display{ font-family:var(--font-display); font-weight:700; font-size:clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 3.25rem); line-height:1.05; letter-spacing:-.01em; margin:0 0 .5rem; }
[dir="rtl"] .yr-display{ font-family:'Tajawal', var(--font-display); font-weight:800; letter-spacing:0; }
.yr-subtitle{ color:var(--color-dust); margin:0; }
[data-bs-theme="dark"] .yr-subtitle{ color:var(--muted); }

.yr-section{ background:var(--color-sky); padding:3rem 0 4rem; }
.yr-section .container{ max-width:760px; }
.yr-card{
  background:#fff; border:1px solid rgba(0,40,76,.08); border-radius:1rem;
  padding:1.75rem; margin-bottom:1.5rem; box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.04);
}
.yr-card:last-child{ margin-bottom:0; }
[data-bs-theme="dark"] .yr-card{ background:var(--surface); border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.08); box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.35); }
.yr-card-heading{ font-family:var(--font-display); font-weight:700; color:var(--brand-dark); font-size:1.25rem; margin-bottom:1rem; }
[dir="rtl"] .yr-card-heading{ font-family:'Tajawal', var(--font-display); font-weight:800; }
[data-bs-theme="dark"] .yr-card-heading{ color:var(--text); }
.yr-card p, .yr-card div{ color:var(--brand-dark); }
[data-bs-theme="dark"] .yr-card p, [data-bs-theme="dark"] .yr-card div{ color:var(--text); }

.yr-ceremony-btn{ border:1px solid rgba(0,40,76,.2); color:var(--brand-dark); background:transparent; }
.yr-ceremony-btn:hover{ background:rgba(0,40,76,.05); color:var(--brand-dark); }
[data-bs-theme="dark"] .yr-ceremony-btn{ border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.2); color:var(--text); }
[data-bs-theme="dark"] .yr-ceremony-btn:hover{ background:rgba(255,255,255,.06); color:var(--text); }

.yr-winners{ list-style:none; padding:0; margin:0; }
.yr-winner-row{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.9rem; padding:.6rem 0; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,40,76,.06); }
[data-bs-theme="dark"] .yr-winner-row{ border-bottom-color:rgba(255,255,255,.06); }
.yr-winner-row:last-child{ border-bottom:0; }
.yr-winner-rank{ font-family:var(--font-display); font-weight:700; font-size:1.35rem; color:var(--color-terra); min-width:2.2rem; }
[dir="rtl"] .yr-winner-rank{ font-family:inherit; font-weight:800; }
[data-bs-theme="dark"] .yr-winner-rank{ color:var(--color-amber); }
.yr-winner-team{ font-weight:600; }

.yr-gallery-btn{ background:var(--color-amber); border:0; color:var(--brand-dark); font-weight:700; }
.yr-gallery-btn:hover{ filter:brightness(1.05); color:var(--brand-dark); }

.yr-ann{ color:var(--color-dust); margin-bottom:.5rem; }
[data-bs-theme="dark"] .yr-ann{ color:var(--muted); }
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}

<section class="yr-hero">
<div class="container" style="max-width:700px;">
  <h1 class="yr-display">{{ locale.content.hero.heading }}</h1>
  <p class="yr-subtitle">{{ locale.content.hero.subtitle }}</p>
</div>
</section>

<section class="yr-section">
<div class="container">

  {% if locale.content.workshops and locale.content.workshops.length %}
  <div class="yr-card">
    <h2 class="yr-card-heading">{{ locale.content.workshopsHeading }}</h2>
    <ol class="yr-winners">
      {% for w in locale.content.workshops %}
      <li class="yr-winner-row">
        <span class="yr-winner-rank">{{ loop.index | pad2 }}</span>
        <span>
          <span class="yr-winner-team">{{ w.title }}</span>
          <div class="small" style="color:var(--color-dust);">{{ w.presenter }} — {{ w.date }}{% if w.time %}, {{ w.time }}{% endif %}</div>
        </span>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  {% if locale.content.ceremony %}
  <div class="yr-card">
    <h2 class="yr-card-heading">{{ locale.content.ceremonyHeading }}</h2>
    <p class="mb-2">
      <i class="bi bi-calendar-event me-2"></i>{{ locale.content.ceremony.date }} — {{ locale.content.ceremony.time }}
    </p>
    <a class="btn btn-sm yr-ceremony-btn" href="{{ locale.content.ceremony.mapHref }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      <i class="bi bi-geo-alt-fill me-1"></i>{{ locale.content.ceremony.location }}
    </a>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  {% if locale.content.winners and locale.content.winners.length %}
  <div class="yr-card">
    <h2 class="yr-card-heading">{{ locale.content.winnersHeading }}</h2>
    <ol class="yr-winners">
      {% for w in locale.content.winners %}
      <li class="yr-winner-row">
        <span class="yr-winner-rank">{{ loop.index | pad2 }}</span>
        <span class="yr-winner-team">{{ w.team }}</span>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  {% if locale.content.galleryHref %}
  <div class="yr-card text-center">
    <h2 class="yr-card-heading">{{ locale.content.galleryHeading }}</h2>
    <p class="mb-3" style="color:var(--color-dust);">{{ locale.content.galleryNote }}</p>
    <a class="btn yr-gallery-btn" href="{{ locale.pathPrefix | default('') }}{{ locale.content.galleryHref }}">
      <i class="bi bi-images me-1"></i>{{ locale.content.galleryButtonLabel }}
    </a>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  {% if locale.content.announcements and locale.content.announcements.length %}
  <div class="yr-card">
    <h2 class="yr-card-heading">{{ locale.content.announcementsHeading }}</h2>
    {% for a in locale.content.announcements %}
    <div class="yr-ann">{{ a.text | safe }}</div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% endif %}

</div>
</section>

{% endblock %}
